    "text": "KYTV\nwebsite\nWillard\nOhio lawmakers visit Missouri as all eyes are on redistricting special session\n4 hours ago\nVolunteers line streets of Willard, Mo., with American flags ahead of 9/11. More than 3,000 American flags line Willard in memory of those lost on 9/11. There are nearly 700 Share the Road signs in Missouri, including 60 in Webster County. But one of our viewers tonight is asking about another road sign: stop signs.",
